      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need some help looking at some stuff. my local water utility company has been doing these \"emergency maintenance\" jobs in my neighborhood constantly lately. like every few nights there’s a crew out there. it feels way too frequent for just pipes. i'm starting to think they aren't just fixing water lines and might be installing something underground to monitor movement or something. can you help me look at the schedule they posted to see if there's a pattern?",
